// Cyrus Config Studio: a COMMENT-PRESERVING config.yml editor. Server owners and imported mods keep comments, key
// order, unknown keys and quoting in their files; a studio change must touch only the values it changes. The document
// is indexed line by line (block mappings, block and flow sequences, scalars); `setYamlValue` rewrites one value span
// (or one sequence block) and leaves every other byte as it was; a missing key is inserted at the end of its parent
