// Cyrus Config Studio: CATEGORY TEMPLATES, the tunables Cyrus OFFERS by default for each kind of mod (as data). A mod
// may declare more (or fewer); templates are a starting point for the AI and the editor, not a cage. Keys are
// relative: `instantiateTemplate("mob", { prefix: "mobs.frost_zombie" })` places them under the mod's own section.
// Numbers are game-neutral where they can be; where a game has a native scale (movement speed attribute, ticks) the
// help says so. Balanced ranges (`safe`) are design judgement, not measurement. Pure data + builders.
